  "details": "This bug is hard to report as it only happens in VR and there isn't much of a visual most the time. \n\nEssentially what happens is at random times, aiming your VR controllers around, you'll end up eventually hearing the quick menu UI as if you were hovering over something in the quick menu, though the quick menu itself is closed.\n\nThis happens at random moments but occurs quite frequently for me in many different worlds, usually while stationary. Opening the quick menu and closing it fixes it temporarily, but ends up happening again a few moments later.\n\nThis only happens on VR and not on Desktop from what I've tested.",
